TypeScript service using Bun, Hono, OpenTelemetry, pino, zod, Biome, tsc, and bun test.

## Quick Reference

| Command | Purpose |
| ------- | ------- |
| `just fmt` | Check formatting |
| `just fmt-fix` | Fix formatting |
| `just lint` | Check linting |
| `just lint-fix` | Fix linting |
| `just typecheck` | Run type checker |
| `just test-unit` | Run unit tests |
| `just test-integration` | Run integration tests |
| `just test-e2e` | Run e2e tests |
| `just test-all` | Run all tests |
| `just test-external` | Run tests hitting external services |
| `just gate` | Fast pre-push check (fmt + lint + typecheck + test-unit) |
| `just gate-expensive` | Full check (gate + integration + e2e) |
| `just gate-external` | Everything (gate-expensive + external) |
| `just dev` | Start dev server |

## Project Structure

```
src/
  index.ts                    # Bun server entry point
  app.ts                      # Hono app factory
  config.ts                   # zod-based env/config validation
  logging.ts                  # pino setup
  telemetry.ts                # OpenTelemetry setup
  routers/                    # HTTP endpoint definitions
    health.ts                 # /healthz, /readyz
  controllers/                # Request orchestration
  services/                   # Business logic
  dtos/                       # Zod request/response schemas
{%- if include_clients %}
  clients/                    # External API/service clients
{%- endif %}
{%- if include_database %}
  db.ts                       # Prisma client setup
  repositories/               # Data access layer
{%- endif %}
tests/
  unit/                       # Unit tests
  integration/                # Integration tests
  e2e/                        # End-to-end tests
```

## Key Conventions

- Source code lives in `src/`.
- **Layering:** routers -> controllers -> services.
- **DTOs** are zod schemas for API I/O, always separate from DB models.
- Health endpoints are always available at `/healthz` and `/readyz`.
- Tests are organized by type in `tests/unit/`, `tests/integration/`, `tests/e2e/`.
- Use `external` in test names for tests that hit external services.
- Run locally with `bun --watch src/index.ts` or `just dev`.

